OL,3,GNEWSAComplaints about pigeons plaguing
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about the
OL,7,Famount of damage pigeons are causing to
OL,8,Ftown centre buildings.
OL,10,FA meeting has heard that pigeons have
OL,11,Fbeen "plaguing" Biggleswade in
OL,12,FBedfordshire and in particular George's
OL,13,FHall which is named after former Prime
OL,14,FMinister David Lloyd George.
OL,16,FNick Fee, trustee of the Biggleswade
OL,17,FLiberal Club, which is responsible for
OL,18,Fthe upkeep of the hall, said that an
OL,19,F"increasing number of pigeons nesting
OL,20,Fand resting on the roof" had led to
OL,21,F"significant faeces".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
