OL,3,GNEWSAComplaints about pigeons plaguing
OL,4,Atown centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Central Bedfordshire
OL,7,FCouncil said its "street cleansing
OL,8,Fteams visit the town centre daily
OL,9,Fremoving pigeon waste wherever
OL,10,Fpossible".
